OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785284296
OL,3,CTrain drivers' union warns of
OL,4,Cindustrial action over lack of decent
OL,5,Ctoilets
OL,7,FGeneral Secretary Dave Calfe said: "We
OL,8,Fneed action, not broken promises, to
OL,9,Fimprove toilet facilities for drivers
OL,10,Fand to reduce the time drivers are
OL,11,Fexpected to go without being able to
OL,12,Ftake a toilet break.
OL,14,F"The health and wellbeing of our
OL,15,Fmembers is not a price we are prepared
OL,16,Fto pay for the inaction of the
OL,17,Findustry.
OL,26,@oD@dOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785284296
OL,3,CTrain drivers' union warns of
OL,4,Cindustrial action over lack of decent
OL,5,Ctoilets
OL,7,F"That's why we are calling them out
OL,8,Fpublicly and telling them ` in no
OL,9,Funcertain terms ` that it is time for
OL,10,Fthem to deliver, to do what they
OL,11,Fpromised. And, if they don't, there
OL,12,Fwill be consequences."
OL,14,FAslef is not ruling out industrial
OL,15,Faction if there is no progress.
OL,17,FThe union published a Dignity For
OL,18,FDrivers report over a year ago which
OL,19,Fit said revealed the scale of the
OL,20,Fproblem.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
