FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785284296
OL,3,CTrain drivers' union warns of
OL,4,Cindustrial action over lack of decent
OL,5,Ctoilets
OL,7,FThe general secretary, Calfe, added:
OL,8,F"Twenty months after we exposed this
OL,9,Fscandal, and a year after the train
OL,10,Fcompanies promised to do the right
OL,11,Fthing, drivers are still paying with
OL,12,Ftheir health for industry inaction.
OL,14,F"We are putting the rail industry on
OL,15,Fnotice that we have had enough of
OL,16,Ftheir excuses."
OL,26,@pD@AOUvD@AOUxD@OO]
